7. MATHEMATICAL FORMULA


The performance score is calculated using:


Score =Attendance × 0.20+ Study Hours Percentage × 0.15+ Previous Marks × 0.25+Assignment × 0.15+ Internal Marks × 0.25


Study Hours Percentage:
Study Hours Percentage =
(Study Hours / 8) × 100


Example:


If a student studies for 5 hours per day:


Study Hours Percentage =
(5 / 8) × 100
= 62.5%


8. PERFORMANCE CLASSIFICATION


The calculated score is classified as follows:


85 or above:
Excellent


70 to below 85:
Good


55 to below 70:
Average


Below 55:
Needs Improvement


